  "question": {
    "text": "A ray of light, travelling in medium A, is incident on plane interface of two media A and B and gets refracted into medium B. The angle of incidence is i and that of refraction is r. Graph between sin(i) and sin(r) is as shown in diagram. The correct statement among the following is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/CA_phys.JPG\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 133px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
